# GenNet agent workflow

- Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes.
- Activate `env_GenNet` and set `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1`.
- Work from the repository root. Use `python GenNet.py` and the toy folders under `examples/`.
- Verify with `pytest tests/test_import.py tests/test_conversion.py tests/test_GenNet.py`.
- Keep PRs small and test-backed. Do not commit `results/`, generated HDF5, or real genotype data.
- Prefer fixing tests and CLI robustness before adding features.
